# Outside el (§5.2), inside el++ (§5.4). Under el every axiom here is
# ENUMERATED as omitted, so the verdict is INCONCLUSIVE (exit 2), never coherent;
# under el++ they are decided.
#
# SameIndividual, DifferentIndividuals, NegativeObjectPropertyAssertion.

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix swrl: <http://www.w3.org/2003/11/swrl#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .
:r a owl:ObjectProperty .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual . :b a owl:NamedIndividual . :c a owl:NamedIndividual .
:a owl:sameAs :b .
:a owl:differentFrom :c .
[] a owl:NegativePropertyAssertion ;
   owl:sourceIndividual :a ; owl:assertionProperty :r ; owl:targetIndividual :c .
